  "content": "<p>這個模組新增了更多種類的釘頭錘（Mace）變體，這是將在 Minecraft 1.21 版本中加入的新武器。</p><p>目前可用的有：鐵砧釘頭錘、烈焰釘頭錘、終界釘頭錘、凋零釘頭錘。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/221/anvil_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"361\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/222/nether_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"359\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/278/end_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"363\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/787/wither_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"362\"></p>",
